  emergence dressed up in Hoel's formalism. What this reveals: the "landscape" 
  is not independent of agents — it is the structure of how agents relate, and 
  that structure genuinely has causal power that no individual agent possesses.

  Monk E fails because: The multi-agent game theory that's supposedly
